============================================================
Step 5: Physical interpretation of generators
============================================================
  Each generator is a direction in log-space along which Pi is preserved.
  Physically: simultaneous rescaling of variables that keeps the
  normalised enthalpy Pi (and therefore the pore fraction) invariant.

  Generator 1:
    P x exp(-0.407*eps), V x exp(+0.897*eps), Lv x exp(-0.108*eps), gamma x exp(-0.110*eps)
    Meaning: increase V while decrease P, decrease Lv, decrease gamma
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 2:
    P x exp(+0.163*eps), A x exp(+0.983*eps)
    Meaning: increase A while increase P
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 3:
    P x exp(-0.144*eps), rho x exp(+0.987*eps)
    Meaning: increase rho while decrease P
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 4:
    P x exp(+0.114*eps), k x exp(+0.992*eps)
    Meaning: increase k while increase P
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 5:
    P x exp(-0.426*eps), V x exp(-0.108*eps), Lv x exp(+0.887*eps), gamma x exp(-0.116*eps)
    Meaning: increase Lv while decrease P, decrease V, decrease gamma
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 6:
    P x exp(+0.153*eps), dT x exp(+0.985*eps)
    Meaning: increase dT while increase P
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 7:
    P x exp(-0.434*eps), V x exp(-0.110*eps), Lv x exp(-0.116*eps), gamma x exp(+0.882*eps)
    Meaning: increase gamma while decrease P, decrease V, decrease Lv
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 8:
    P x exp(+0.098*eps), Tb x exp(+0.994*eps)
    Meaning: increase Tb while increase P
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 9:
    Pe_vap x exp(+0.999*eps)

  Generator 10:
    P x exp(+0.070*eps), Pr x exp(+0.997*eps)
    Meaning: increase Pr while increase P
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged


